PACK pack 1
-- A Pack is an entity `Pack:<name>` whose `text` is c1f (docs/cliffvm.md, "Pack entities"). The host loads the text when it is written
-- and mirrors the outcome back as `loaded`, `error` and `good_text`; this pack only names the class (so a write to a new `Pack:x` makes
-- the entity) and says in one word what became of the last text.
Pack.state getter: 'error' if this.error != None else ('loaded' if this.loaded == True else 'waiting')
